# Files excluded from the packaged VSIX. Ship only the bundled extension (dist/),
# the activity-bar icon (media/), the manifest, and the README. Everything else —
# source, tests, the electron-smoke harness, configs, lockfile, node_modules — is
# build/dev-only and must not ride along in the artifact.
